<title>UK: Wessex Water yr pretax profits up 8 percent.</title>
<headline>Wessex Water yr pretax profits up 8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(diluted)   43.5		   vs 47.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 12.3		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 18.0		   vs 15.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     145.0		  vs 133.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   254.3		  vs 240.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 144.4 and 147.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Wessex Water Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
